The xz x86 BCJ filter (documented informally in many places, e.g., xz man page and various writeups):

- Scans for bytes 0xE8 (call) or 0xE9 (jmp).
- For each occurrence at position i (needs i+5 <= size): read 32-bit LE at i+1 (src).
